# Host-side tooling. Distinct from the container environment (pinned by base
# image digest in each task's environment/Dockerfile) — this is what runs
# check_oracles.py, provenance.py and run_experiment.py on the laptop.
#
# Until now this was whatever `uv run --with ...` happened to resolve, which is
# how the oracle gate silently stopped working: a fresh empty .venv shadowed the
# ephemeral env and vendor/tau2's imports vanished. Pinned here so `python` in
# this repo means one thing.

# vendor/tau2 domain imports (no LLM stack — see vendor/SOURCE.txt)
pydantic
deepdiff
addict
loguru
python-dotenv
toml
pyyaml
docstring-parser

